      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 232,
        "content": "## Production URL only\n\nQuery parameter prefill fills the session_code hidden field on the PRODUCTION form URL only. Test mode ignores query parameters, so a QR walkthrough staged on the test URL records blank session codes. Stage the QR walkthrough on the production URL."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a7bab3d3-be5b-4471-9d72-c5c215b87c23",
      "name": "Completion screen warning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1184,
        -496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 568,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## Keep the line moving\n\nEvery branch must end on a form completion screen or the kiosk browser hangs and the line backs up. The Slack alert runs with onError continue so a failed post can never strand the success screen."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "115490c6-4c40-42c3-acad-10c070f4fbc1",
      "name": "Section intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1384,
        "height": 436,
        "content": "## Intake and dedupe gate\n\nThe form takes one typed field, email. session_code arrives prefilled from the QR query parameter. The rowNotExists check matches the email plus session composite key, and duplicates exit on their own completion screen."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
